{"seq":4,"slug":"help-and-documentation","title":"帮助与文档","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/user-experience/help-and-documentation","wordCount":744,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"帮助与文档\">帮助与文档</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>帮助系统</strong>（Help System）是用户发现与学习工具功能的入口。好的帮助是<strong>分层的</strong>：急需回忆用短帮助，初次上手看长帮助，深入查阅用 man page，日常使用靠 shell 补全。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>触发</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>短帮助</td>\n<td><code>-h</code></td>\n<td>一行简介 + 参数列表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长帮助</td>\n<td><code>--help</code></td>\n<td>详细说明 + 示例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Man page</td>\n<td><code>man mytool</code></td>\n<td>完整参考文档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shell 补全</td>\n<td>Tab</td>\n<td>交互式自动补全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在线文档</td>\n<td>URL</td>\n<td>教程 + API 参考</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实现上应尽量<strong>从参数定义自动生成</strong>帮助（clap、Commander 均可），避免帮助与代码脱节。本文据此讲解自动生成、Man page、补全与设计原则。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"帮助系统的层次\">帮助系统的层次</h2><p>CLI 工具的<strong>帮助系统</strong>（Help System）是用户发现和学习功能的主要途径。一个完整的帮助体系包含多个层次，从快速查看到深入参考。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>触发方式</th>\n<th>内容深度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>短帮助</td>\n<td><code>-h</code></td>\n<td>一行简介 + 参数列表</td>\n<td>快速提醒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长帮助</td>\n<td><code>--help</code></td>\n<td>详细说明 + 示例</td>\n<td>首次学习</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Man page</td>\n<td><code>man mytool</code></td>\n<td>完整参考文档</td>\n<td>深入查阅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shell 补全</td>\n<td>Tab 键</td>\n<td>自动补全建议</td>\n<td>日常使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在线文档</td>\n<td>URL</td>\n<td>教程 + API 参考</td>\n<td>系统学习</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[用户需要帮助] --&gt; B{了解程度}&#10;    B --&gt;|完全陌生| C[--help 长帮助]&#10;    B --&gt;|忘记参数| D[-h 短帮助]&#10;    B --&gt;|日常使用| E[Tab 补全]&#10;    B --&gt;|深入细节| F[man page]\">graph TD\n    A[用户需要帮助] --&gt; B{了解程度}\n    B --&gt;|完全陌生| C[--help 长帮助]\n    B --&gt;|忘记参数| D[-h 短帮助]\n    B --&gt;|日常使用| E[Tab 补全]\n    B --&gt;|深入细节| F[man page]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"help-自动生成\">--help 自动生成</h2><p>主流参数解析库都能自动生成格式化的帮助输出。在 Rust 的 <strong>clap</strong> 中，帮助信息从结构体注解和文档注释中自动提取。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use clap::{Parser, Subcommand};&#10;&#10;/// 高性能文件搜索工具&#10;///&#10;/// 支持正则表达式、文件类型过滤和递归搜索。&#10;/// 默认忽略 .gitignore 中的文件。&#10;#[derive(Parser)]&#10;#[command(name = &quot;search&quot;, version, about, long_about)]&#10;#[command(after_help = &quot;示例:\\n  search &#39;fn main&#39; --type rs\\n  search TODO --ignore-case\\n  search &#39;^import&#39; src/&quot;)]&#10;struct Cli {&#10;    /// 搜索模式（支持正则表达式）&#10;    pattern: String,&#10;&#10;    /// 搜索目录（默认当前目录）&#10;    #[arg(default_value = &quot;.&quot;)]&#10;    path: String,&#10;&#10;    /// 忽略大小写&#10;    #[arg(short, long)]&#10;    ignore_case: bool,&#10;&#10;    /// 限制文件类型（如 rs, ts, py）&#10;    #[arg(short = &#39;t&#39;, long = &quot;type&quot;)]&#10;    file_type: Option&lt;String&gt;,&#10;&#10;    /// 显示匹配行的上下文行数&#10;    #[arg(short = &#39;C&#39;, long, default_value_t = 0)]&#10;    context: usize,&#10;&#10;    /// 最大搜索深度&#10;    #[arg(long)]&#10;    max_depth: Option&lt;usize&gt;,&#10;&#10;    /// 输出格式&#10;    #[arg(long, default_value = &quot;text&quot;, value_parser = [&quot;text&quot;, &quot;json&quot;, &quot;count&quot;])]&#10;    format: String,&#10;&#10;    #[command(subcommand)]&#10;    command: Option&lt;Commands&gt;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[derive(Subcommand)]&#10;enum Commands {&#10;    /// 列出支持的文件类型&#10;    ListTypes,&#10;    /// 生成 shell 补全脚本&#10;    Completions {&#10;        /// 目标 shell 类型&#10;        #[arg(value_parser = [&quot;bash&quot;, &quot;zsh&quot;, &quot;fish&quot;, &quot;powershell&quot;])]&#10;        shell: String,&#10;    },&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let cli = Cli::parse();&#10;    println!(&quot;搜索 &#39;{}&#39; 在 {}&quot;, cli.pattern, cli.path);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use clap::{Parser, Subcommand};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/// 高性能文件搜索工具</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>///</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/// 支持正则表达式、文件类型过滤和递归搜索。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/// 默认忽略 .gitignore 中的文件。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[derive(Parser)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[command(name = \"search\", version, about, long_about)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[command(after_help = \"示例:\\n  search 'fn main' --type rs\\n  search TODO --ignore-case\\n  search '^import' src/\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct Cli {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    /// 搜索模式（支持正则表达式）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pattern: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    /// 搜索目录（默认当前目录）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[arg(default_value = \".\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    path: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    /// 忽略大小写</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[arg(short, long)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ignore_case: bool,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    /// 限制文件类型（如 rs, ts, py）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[arg(short = 't', long = \"type\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    file_type: Option&#x3C;String>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    /// 显示匹配行的上下文行数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[arg(short = 'C', long, default_value_t = 0)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    context: usize,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    /// 最大搜索深度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[arg(long)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    max_depth: Option&#x3C;usize>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    /// 输出格式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[arg(long, default_value = \"text\", value_parser = [\"text\", \"json\", \"count\"])]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    format: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[command(subcommand)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    command: Option&#x3C;Commands>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[derive(Subcommand)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>enum Commands {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    /// 列出支持的文件类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ListTypes,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    /// 生成 shell 补全脚本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Completions {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        /// 目标 shell 类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        #[arg(value_parser = [\"bash\", \"zsh\", \"fish\", \"powershell\"])]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        shell: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let cli = Cli::parse();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"搜索 '{}' 在 {}\", cli.pattern, cli.path);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>运行 <code>search --help</code> 输出：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"高性能文件搜索工具&#10;&#10;支持正则表达式、文件类型过滤和递归搜索。&#10;默认忽略 .gitignore 中的文件。&#10;&#10;Usage: search [OPTIONS] &lt;PATTERN&gt; [PATH] [COMMAND]&#10;&#10;Commands:&#10;  list-types   列出支持的文件类型&#10;  completions  生成 shell 补全脚本&#10;&#10;Arguments:&#10;  &lt;PATTERN&gt;  搜索模式（支持正则表达式）&#10;  [PATH]     搜索目录（默认当前目录） [default: .]&#10;&#10;Options:&#10;  -i, --ignore-case        忽略大小写&#10;  -t, --type &lt;FILE_TYPE&gt;   限制文件类型（如 rs, ts, py）&#10;  -C, --context &lt;CONTEXT&gt;  显示匹配行的上下文行数 [default: 0]&#10;      --max-depth &lt;N&gt;      最大搜索深度&#10;      --format &lt;FORMAT&gt;    输出格式 [default: text]&#10;  -h, --help               Print help&#10;  -V, --version            Print version&#10;&#10;示例:&#10;  search &#39;fn main&#39; --type rs&#10;  search TODO --ignore-case&#10;  search &#39;^import&#39; src/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>高性能文件搜索工具</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>支持正则表达式、文件类型过滤和递归搜索。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>默认忽略 .gitignore 中的文件。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Usage: search [OPTIONS] &#x3C;PATTERN> [PATH] [COMMAND]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Commands:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  list-types   列出支持的文件类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  completions  生成 shell 补全脚本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Arguments:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;PATTERN>  搜索模式（支持正则表达式）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  [PATH]     搜索目录（默认当前目录） [default: .]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Options:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  -i, --ignore-case        忽略大小写</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  -t, --type &#x3C;FILE_TYPE>   限制文件类型（如 rs, ts, py）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  -C, --context &#x3C;CONTEXT>  显示匹配行的上下文行数 [default: 0]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      --max-depth &#x3C;N>      最大搜索深度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      --format &#x3C;FORMAT>    输出格式 [default: text]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  -h, --help               Print help</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  -V, --version            Print version</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>示例:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  search 'fn main' --type rs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  search TODO --ignore-case</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  search '^import' src/</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"man-pages-生成\">Man Pages 生成</h2><p><strong>Man pages</strong> 是 Unix 系统中的标准文档格式。clap 生态提供了 <code>clap_mangen</code> 用于自动生成 man pages。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// build.rs&#10;use clap::CommandFactory;&#10;use clap_mangen::Man;&#10;use std::fs;&#10;&#10;#[path = &quot;src/cli.rs&quot;]&#10;mod cli;&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let out_dir = std::env::var(&quot;OUT_DIR&quot;).unwrap();&#10;    let cmd = cli::Cli::command();&#10;&#10;    let man = Man::new(cmd.clone());&#10;    let mut buffer = Vec::new();&#10;    man.render(&amp;mut buffer).unwrap();&#10;&#10;    let man_path = format!(&quot;{}/search.1&quot;, out_dir);&#10;    fs::write(&amp;man_path, buffer).unwrap();&#10;&#10;    for sub in cmd.get_subcommands() {&#10;        let mut buffer = Vec::new();&#10;        Man::new(sub.clone()).render(&amp;mut buffer).unwrap();&#10;        let path = format!(&quot;{}/search-{}.1&quot;, out_dir, sub.get_name());&#10;        fs::write(&amp;path, buffer).unwrap();&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// build.rs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use clap::CommandFactory;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use clap_mangen::Man;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::fs;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[path = \"src/cli.rs\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>mod cli;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let out_dir = std::env::var(\"OUT_DIR\").unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let cmd = cli::Cli::command();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let man = Man::new(cmd.clone());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut buffer = Vec::new();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    man.render(&#x26;mut buffer).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let man_path = format!(\"{}/search.1\", out_dir);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fs::write(&#x26;man_path, buffer).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for sub in cmd.get_subcommands() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let mut buffer = Vec::new();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Man::new(sub.clone()).render(&#x26;mut buffer).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let path = format!(\"{}/search-{}.1\", out_dir, sub.get_name());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fs::write(&#x26;path, buffer).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Man page 章节</th>\n<th>编号</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用户命令</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>CLI 工具文档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>系统调用</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>系统编程接口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库函数</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>C 库函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件格式</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>配置文件格式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"shell-completions\">Shell Completions</h2><p><strong>Shell 补全</strong>（Shell Completions）让用户按 Tab 键自动补全命令、子命令和参数，极大提升日常使用效率。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use clap::{Command, Arg};&#10;use clap_complete::{generate, shells};&#10;use std::io;&#10;&#10;fn build_cli() -&gt; Command {&#10;    Command::new(&quot;mytool&quot;)&#10;        .version(&quot;1.0.0&quot;)&#10;        .subcommand(Command::new(&quot;init&quot;).arg(Arg::new(&quot;name&quot;).required(true)))&#10;        .subcommand(Command::new(&quot;build&quot;).arg(Arg::new(&quot;release&quot;).long(&quot;release&quot;)))&#10;        .subcommand(Command::new(&quot;deploy&quot;).arg(&#10;            Arg::new(&quot;env&quot;).long(&quot;env&quot;).value_parser([&quot;dev&quot;, &quot;staging&quot;, &quot;prod&quot;])&#10;        ))&#10;        .subcommand(Command::new(&quot;completions&quot;).arg(&#10;            Arg::new(&quot;shell&quot;)&#10;                .required(true)&#10;                .value_parser([&quot;bash&quot;, &quot;zsh&quot;, &quot;fish&quot;, &quot;powershell&quot;])&#10;        ))&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let matches = build_cli().get_matches();&#10;&#10;    if let Some(sub) = matches.subcommand_matches(&quot;completions&quot;) {&#10;        let shell_name = sub.get_one::&lt;String&gt;(&quot;shell&quot;).unwrap();&#10;        let mut cmd = build_cli();&#10;        match shell_name.as_str() {&#10;            &quot;bash&quot; =&gt; generate(shells::Bash, &amp;mut cmd, &quot;mytool&quot;, &amp;mut io::stdout()),&#10;            &quot;zsh&quot; =&gt; generate(shells::Zsh, &amp;mut cmd, &quot;mytool&quot;, &amp;mut io::stdout()),&#10;            &quot;fish&quot; =&gt; generate(shells::Fish, &amp;mut cmd, &quot;mytool&quot;, &amp;mut io::stdout()),&#10;            _ =&gt; eprintln!(&quot;不支持的 shell: {}&quot;, shell_name),&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use clap::{Command, Arg};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use clap_complete::{generate, shells};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::io;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn build_cli() -> Command {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Command::new(\"mytool\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .version(\"1.0.0\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .subcommand(Command::new(\"init\").arg(Arg::new(\"name\").required(true)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .subcommand(Command::new(\"build\").arg(Arg::new(\"release\").long(\"release\")))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .subcommand(Command::new(\"deploy\").arg(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Arg::new(\"env\").long(\"env\").value_parser([\"dev\", \"staging\", \"prod\"])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .subcommand(Command::new(\"completions\").arg(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Arg::new(\"shell\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .required(true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .value_parser([\"bash\", \"zsh\", \"fish\", \"powershell\"])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let matches = build_cli().get_matches();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if let Some(sub) = matches.subcommand_matches(\"completions\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let shell_name = sub.get_one::&#x3C;String>(\"shell\").unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let mut cmd = build_cli();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        match shell_name.as_str() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"bash\" => generate(shells::Bash, &#x26;mut cmd, \"mytool\", &#x26;mut io::stdout()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"zsh\" => generate(shells::Zsh, &#x26;mut cmd, \"mytool\", &#x26;mut io::stdout()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"fish\" => generate(shells::Fish, &#x26;mut cmd, \"mytool\", &#x26;mut io::stdout()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            _ => eprintln!(\"不支持的 shell: {}\", shell_name),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>安装补全脚本的常见方式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# Bash&#10;mytool completions bash &gt; ~/.local/share/bash-completion/completions/mytool&#10;&#10;# Zsh&#10;mytool completions zsh &gt; ~/.zfunc/_mytool&#10;&#10;# Fish&#10;mytool completions fish &gt; ~/.config/fish/completions/mytool.fish\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Bash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mytool</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> completions</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bash</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/.local/share/bash-completion/completions/mytool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Zsh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mytool</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> completions</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> zsh</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/.zfunc/_mytool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Fish</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mytool</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> completions</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fish</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/.config/fish/completions/mytool.fish</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"帮助信息设计原则\">帮助信息设计原则</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原则</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>实践</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>渐进式详细</td>\n<td><code>-h</code> 简洁，<code>--help</code> 详细</td>\n<td>clap 支持 <code>long_about</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包含示例</td>\n<td>展示典型使用场景</td>\n<td><code>after_help</code> 中添加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分组组织</td>\n<td>相关选项归为一组</td>\n<td><code>help_heading</code> 属性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误引导</td>\n<td>错误时提示正确用法</td>\n<td>clap 自动实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发现性</td>\n<td>子命令和选项名称直觉化</td>\n<td>一致的命名约定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在帮助信息的末尾添加常见使用示例，这是用户最快速的学习途径。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((帮助与文档))&#10;    --help&#10;      自动生成&#10;      短帮助与长帮助&#10;      使用示例&#10;    Man pages&#10;      clap_mangen&#10;      标准 Unix 文档&#10;      章节编号&#10;    Shell 补全&#10;      Bash/Zsh/Fish&#10;      clap_complete&#10;      Tab 自动补全&#10;    设计原则&#10;      渐进式详细&#10;      包含示例&#10;      选项分组\">mindmap\n  root((帮助与文档))\n    --help\n      自动生成\n      短帮助与长帮助\n      使用示例\n    Man pages\n      clap_mangen\n      标准 Unix 文档\n      章节编号\n    Shell 补全\n      Bash/Zsh/Fish\n      clap_complete\n      Tab 自动补全\n    设计原则\n      渐进式详细\n      包含示例\n      选项分组</pre><ul>\n<li>帮助系统应分层提供：-h 快速查看、--help 详细学习、man page 完整参考</li>\n<li>clap 从结构体注解和文档注释自动生成帮助输出，after_help 添加使用示例</li>\n<li>clap_mangen 生成标准 man pages，clap_complete 生成 shell 补全脚本</li>\n<li>Shell 补全是提升日常使用效率的最有效手段，应为主流 shell 提供补全脚本</li>\n<li>帮助信息应包含具体的使用示例，这比参数列表对新用户更有价值</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"帮助与文档","id":"帮助与文档"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"帮助系统的层次","id":"帮助系统的层次"},{"level":2,"text":"--help 自动生成","id":"help-自动生成"},{"level":2,"text":"Man Pages 生成","id":"man-pages-生成"},{"level":2,"text":"Shell Completions","id":"shell-completions"},{"level":2,"text":"帮助信息设计原则","id":"帮助信息设计原则"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"颜色与格式化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/user-experience/color-and-formatting"},"next":{"title":"Clap 深入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/rust-cli/clap-deep-dive"}}